		{
			dependencies: ["1935CFAC6173A06F"]
			description: [
				"Once you've gotten enough materials, you'll probably want to start upgrading your gear, right? That's where the &o&6Reforging Table&r comes into play, allowing you to change an item's rarity and affixes. The Simple variant allows you to reforge an item up to &9&oRare&r."
				"Using the Reforging Table, you'll be met with 3 input slots. The center slot is for the item you are reforging. The bottom right slot holds &o&6Sigils of Rebirth&r, crafted with gem fused slates and gem dust. Finally, the top left slot is for your rarity materials. Once all items are placed inside, you will be given three random options, just like an enchanting table. These options all take experience, Sigils of Rebirth, and rarity materials."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/simple-reforging-table.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "apotheosis:simple_reforging_table"
			id: "5B841122EFD8854C"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "2DAA2E9F0388D767"
				ignore_reward_blocking: true
				type: "eternalcurrencies:currency"
			}]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "5F67FBE4CFC0619A"
					item: "apotheosis:simple_reforging_table"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 6L
