			title: "Given New Purpose"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["43AE403E62C96F66"]
			description: ["If you're ever in a situation where you'd like to &oremove&r a gem from one of your items, you can craft a &o&6Sigil of Withdrawal&r. &6&oPutting the sigil in a smithing table with your item will remove all the gems in its sockets.&r"]
			id: "15324C27CC683196"
