		{
			dependencies: ["5B841122EFD8854C"]
			description: [
				"At the very top of an affix's power is the &o&6Augmentation Table&r requiring the power of a &oNether Star&r to create. Using it, &o&6you are able to strengthen or reroll specific affixes&r."
				"Using the table will show a UI with two slots on the left. These are for the item you wish to augment and &o&6Sigils of Enhancement&r, crafted with a &cGodforged Pearl&r. Once all the items are put in, a drop down menu will show, allowing you to select the affix you wish to augment. From there, you simply select the option you'd like at the bottom."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/augmentation-table.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "apotheosis:augmenting_table"
			id: "35FF8397225F4952"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 250L
				currency: "eternalcurrencies:ancientcoins"
				id: "2575A39AAE24D12B"
